# Video pipeline

9:16, 1080×1920. Human control in `editor.html`. Render HyperFrames `0.8.30`.

**Show locked:** transparent cards, unique enter/exit per card, keyword caption pop, max 2×8s b-roll whip, PIP left, 1 hero 3D, ≤1 special moment (drone/crash/mockup…). See `shared/SHOW_STANDARD.md`. Topic copy only — never reuse 0907 text.

**0907 is the show bible.** Every new talking-head gets the same flow. The agent analyzes this video's transcript and writes **new** cards and b-roll for this topic. Do not leave empty `cards.html`.

On new source / `project.json` ready: follow the package-nihat-video skill at the workspace `.cursor/skills/package-nihat-video/SKILL.md` and `shared/show-flow.json`. Clone card HTML structure from `videos/0907/cards.html`.

## New video

```
python scripts/new_video.py 0910 --source "D:\path.mp4" --account nihat
```

Human: editor → `project.json` (cuts + captions).

Agent: read transcript → plan beats → `cards.html` + `public/broll` + `timeline.json` → `build_composition.py` → tell user Ctrl+F5 → draft then high render.

## Locked

- Captions: **Montserrat Black karaoke** (dim → accent → white). Max 2 lines. Soft **opacity-only** enter. **Tek ortak konum** `layout.caption` — dashboard `/captions` ok tuşları veya `/api/caption-pos` (40px) → rebuild → Ctrl+F5. Studio’da altyazı sürükleme **yasak**. Satır `captions[i].x/y` yok. No `paintCap` onUpdate. No full-frame darkening.
- Layout: face full-bleed; **cards only y56–280 (above forehead)**; face clear y300–1100; captions mid-chest (~y1208 default); IG right rail clear; PIP **left**.
- Talking-head: unmuted `<video data-has-audio="true">`. No second VO from the same file.
- `#overlays` has no `data-start`. Root clips `top:0;left:0`. Cards nested in untimed `#overlays`.
- IG follow: animated Instagram Follow (Nihat / @cetin.finans / avatar) — mid + near end, ~4.5s, exclusive. No frozen PNG; no banner `m4a`.
- Punch: hold then ease out. Soft `click-soft` + `sub-hit` on zoom in; click out. Scales 1.10–1.16.
- **Kart geçiş (kilit):** cam kit; enter `soft|rise|slide|scale` ~0.42s `expo.out` + `pop.mp3` + sheen; exit ~0.38s; hold breathe only. Opening **hook** kapalı. Bounce/glitch/slam yok. 1 hero 3D / video.
- B-roll: muted 9:16, **max 2×8s**, PIP left, whip + whoosh. Labs prompts in `public/broll/LABS_PROMPTS.md`.
- Disclaimer: transparent, centered **YATIRIM TAVSİYESİ DEĞİL** only, bottom (~y1580), no NİHAT plate.
- Standard notes: `shared/SHOW_STANDARD.md` + `shared/show-flow.json`.
- After rebuild: rewrite `index.html` from the builder; tell user Ctrl+F5.
- Do not use `C:\Users\nihat\Downloads\project.json` (old C0082).
- NVENC unavailable here; encode with libx264 GOP 15. `--gpu` will not help.

## Per video (content only)

Cuts, caption times, card copy, b-roll files, punch times. Look stays in `shared/`.
